    "description": "<div><p><em>Weapon (Dagger), Rare</em></p></div><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p><p>You can take a Bonus Action to magically coat the blade with poison. The poison remains for 1 minute or until an attack using this weapon hits a creature. That creature must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or take 2d10 Poison damage and have the Poisoned condition for 1 minute. The weapon can't be used this way again until the next dawn.</p>",
